                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "capelins"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "e336a003-c2a5-4c36-b4c1-68b75ffdf2c2",
                        "entry_id": "5fb92227-1b36-3fae-8c75-4ccdfe4ffa46",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "capelin"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5bed706f-68fd-326e-8290-91a7e9ad9ccc",
                        "entry_id": "5fb92227-1b36-3fae-8c75-4ccdfe4ffa46",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A fish of species Mallotus villosus, a type of smelt found in the Atlantic and Arctic oceans."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a84600aa-2777-46ad-96c7-d4eafa1fd1f5",
                                "sense_id": "5bed706f-68fd-326e-8290-91a7e9ad9ccc",
                                "text": "The birds are spread - so that we can see what they are like; and the men catching capelins are elevated up out of the umiak, where they practically float on the gunwale, so that we can perceive that they are the main figures and see their work-movements (fig. 250)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "38d8a275-dadc-43e9-8c79-e055e89956e0",
                                "sense_id": "5bed706f-68fd-326e-8290-91a7e9ad9ccc",
                                "text": "Capelin are widely distributed in the Gulf of Alaska, Bering Sea, and Sea Okhotsk, and along the Kamchatka Peninsula."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "412b5041-c6ca-4b04-ac77-a4becc7f34a3",
                                "sense_id": "5bed706f-68fd-326e-8290-91a7e9ad9ccc",
                                "text": "Capelin is a relatively small, pelagic species found in the North-East Atlantic, the Barents Sea, Southwest of Greenland, off the coast of Labrador, and around Newfoundland."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
